pattern()'s typed refusals (unknown_spec, incommensurate_extent,
unreceived_origin, ...) carry no boolean `moved`, so witness's guard
swallowed them all as "pattern not established", destroying type and
detail. made_no_difference is a substantive verdict ("perceived, and
therefore not testimony"); a methodological refusal must never wear it.
witness already passed its other upstream gaps through verbatim
(admissible via `return bad`; isGap(figure) one line up) — pattern was
the sole asymmetry.

Drafted by a 1.5B local model (qwen2.5-coder-1.5b-instruct) through
the-fold's referent-scout/byte-derived-delta pipeline on its second
attempt, repaired by measured evidence alone; verified by four mechanical
witness tiers (syntax, 19-probe differential no-throw, a declared intent
probe, this suite baseline-compared) and three independent adversarial
review lenses including a 650-combination differential against this
module. Pinned in confabulation.test.js with a real pattern() gap.
Suite: 1188/1175 pass, same 10 pre-existing environment failures, zero
regressions.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
